<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{% block title %}AInformer{% endblock %}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{% block description %}由 DeepSeek 与公开信息源自动生成的中文 AI 资讯日报{% endblock %}">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@24,400,0,0&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#ffffff;
  --surface:#faf8fe;
  --surface-low:#f4f3f8;
  --surface-mid:#eeedf3;
  --surface-high:#e9e7ed;
  --border:#c7c6ca;
  --border-soft:#e3e2e7;

  --primary:#030304;
  --on-surface:#1a1b1f;
  --secondary:#5d5e60;
  --tertiary:#77767b;
  --muted:#9a999d;

  --accent:#ba1a1a;
  --accent-soft:#fff0ef;
  --positive:#2e7d32;
  --positive-soft:#e8f5e9;
  --highlight:#a05a00;
  --highlight-soft:#fff5e1;
  --info:#1f4a82;
  --info-soft:#eaf0f9;

  --container:1200px;
  --gutter:24px;

  --font-sans:'Inter','Noto Sans SC','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --font-mono:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
}

*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--on-surface);
  font-family:var(--font-sans);
  font-size:16px;
  line-height:1.6;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
  font-feature-settings:"ss01","cv11";
}
::selection{background:#1a1b1f;color:#fff}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}

h1,h2,h3,h4,h5{font-family:var(--font-sans);color:var(--primary);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
p{margin:0}

a{color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:border-color .2s ease,color .2s ease,opacity .2s ease}
a:hover{opacity:.7}

code{
  background:var(--surface-mid);
  padding:1px 6px;
  border-radius:3px;
  font-family:var(--font-mono);
  font-size:.86em;
  color:var(--primary);
  border:1px solid var(--border-soft);
}
pre.code{
  background:var(--surface-mid);
  border:1px solid var(--border-soft);
  border-radius:6px;
  padding:14px 16px;
  overflow:auto;
  margin:10px 0;
  font-size:.84rem;
  line-height:1.65;
  font-family:var(--font-mono);
}
pre.code code{background:transparent;padding:0;border:none}

.material-symbols-outlined{
  font-family:'Material Symbols Outlined';
  font-weight:400;
  font-style:normal;
  font-size:24px;
  line-height:1;
  letter-spacing:normal;
  text-transform:none;
  display:inline-block;
  white-space:nowrap;
  word-wrap:normal;
  direction:ltr;
  vertical-align:middle;
  font-feature-settings:'liga';
  -webkit-font-feature-settings:'liga';
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}

.container{max-width:var(--container);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
@media(min-width:1024px){.container{padding:0 64px}}

/* ===== Top app bar (sticky nav) ===== */
.sticky-nav{
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:50;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(14px);
  backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft);
}
.nav-inner{
  max-width:var(--container);
  margin:0 auto;
  padding:0 24px;
  height:64px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:24px;
}
@media(min-width:1024px){.nav-inner{padding:0 64px}}
.nav-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;min-width:0}
.nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.nav-inner .home{
  font-size:20px;
  font-weight:800;
  color:var(--primary);
  letter-spacing:-0.02em;
  border:none;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
.nav-inner .home:hover{opacity:1;color:var(--primary)}
.nav-inner .home .dot{color:var(--accent)}
.nav-links{display:none;gap:24px;align-items:center}
@media(min-width:768px){.nav-links{display:flex}}
.nav-inner a:not(.home):not(.cta){
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:500;
  letter-spacing:.02em;
  color:var(--secondary);
  border:none;
  padding:6px 0;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
.nav-inner a:not(.home):not(.cta):hover{color:var(--primary);opacity:1}
.nav-inner .cta{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:6px;
  padding:8px 14px;
  background:var(--primary);
  color:#fff;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:.02em;
  border-radius:6px;
  border:none;
  transition:transform .15s ease,opacity .2s ease;
}
.nav-inner .cta:hover{opacity:.9;color:#fff}
.nav-inner .cta:active{transform:scale(.96)}

/* ===== Hero ===== */
.hero{
  padding:96px 24px 80px;
  text-align:center;
  background:var(--bg);
}
@media(min-width:1024px){.hero{padding:120px 64px 96px}}
.hero .date{
  display:inline-block;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:600;
  font-family:var(--font-mono);
  letter-spacing:.06em;
  color:#fff;
  background:var(--primary);
  padding:6px 12px;
  border-radius:4px;
  margin-bottom:24px;
}
.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,72px);
  line-height:1.05;
  letter-spacing:-0.035em;
  font-weight:700;
  color:var(--primary);
  margin-bottom:18px;
}
.hero .theme{
  max-width:640px;
  margin:0 auto;
  font-size:18px;
  line-height:1.6;
  color:var(--secondary);
  font-weight:400;
}
.hero .meta{
  margin-top:28px;
  display:inline-flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:8px;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:500;
  letter-spacing:.08em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tertiary);
}
.hero .meta span{
  padding:5px 10px;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:3px;
  background:transparent;
}

/* ===== Lede ===== */
.lede{
  max-width:780px;
  margin:0 auto 96px;
  padding:0;
  background:transparent;
  border:none;
  border-radius:0;
}
.lede::before{
  content:"今日速读 · Editorial";
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  font-size:11px;
  font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:.18em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--accent);
  border:1px solid var(--accent);
  padding:4px 10px;
  border-radius:3px;
  width:fit-content;
  margin-bottom:28px;
}
.lede{
  font-size:19px;
  line-height:1.75;
  color:var(--primary);
  font-weight:400;
}
.lede::first-letter{
  font-size:64px;
  font-weight:700;
  float:left;
  line-height:.9;
  margin:6px 12px 0 0;
  color:var(--primary);
  letter-spacing:-0.03em;
}

/* ===== Section ===== */
.section{margin:0 0 96px}
.section-head{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:16px;
  margin-bottom:40px;
  padding-bottom:0;
  border-bottom:none;
}
.section-head h2{
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:.18em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--secondary);
}
.section-head .count{
  font-size:11px;
  font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:.12em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tertiary);
  font-family:var(--font-mono);
}
.subhead{
  margin:32px 0 16px;
  font-size:18px;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--secondary);
  letter-spacing:.02em;
  display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;
}
.subhead:first-child{margin-top:8px}
.subhead .subcount{
  font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;
  color:var(--tertiary);font-family:var(--font-mono);
}
.quote-card.analyst::before{content:"✎"}
.section-divider{
  height:1px;
  background:var(--border-soft);
  margin:0 0 96px;
}

/* ===== Headlines ===== */
.headlines{display:grid;gap:32px}
@media(min-width:768px){.headlines{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px}}
.headline-card{
  position:relative;
  padding:4px 0 4px 24px;
  border-left:3px solid var(--primary);
  background:transparent;
  border-radius:0;
  transition:border-color .2s ease;
}
.headline-card:nth-child(1){border-left-color:var(--accent)}
.headline-card:hover{border-left-color:var(--accent)}
.headline-card::before{content:none}
.headline-card h3{
  font-size:24px;
  line-height:1.25;
  letter-spacing:-0.015em;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--primary);
  margin-bottom:14px;
}
.headline-card p{
  font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.65;
  color:var(--secondary);
  margin-bottom:18px;
}
.headline-card .meta{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:10px;
  align-items:center;
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--tertiary);
}

/* ===== News cards ===== */
.cards{display:grid;gap:24px}
@media(min-width:768px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(min-width:1280px){.cards.three-col{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
.news-card{
  position:relative;
  background:var(--bg);
  border:1px solid var(--border-soft);
  border-radius:6px;
  padding:28px 28px 24px;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  gap:14px;
  transition:border-color .2s ease,box-shadow .25s ease,transform .2s ease;
}
.news-card::before{content:none}
.news-card:hover{
  border-color:var(--border);
  box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(15,15,20,0.05);
  transform:translateY(-2px);
}
.news-card h3{
  font-size:18px;
  line-height:1.35;
  font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:-0.005em;
  color:var(--primary);
}
.news-card .summary{
  font-size:14.5px;
  line-height:1.65;
  color:var(--secondary);
  flex-grow:1;
}
.news-card .value{
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.6;
  color:var(--primary);
  background:var(--positive-soft);
  border-left:none;
  border-radius:4px;
  padding:10px 12px;
  position:relative;
}
.news-card .value::before{
  content:"VALUE";
  display:block;
  font-size:9px;
  font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:.2em;
  color:var(--positive);
  margin-bottom:4px;
}
.news-card .meta{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:10px;
  align-items:center;
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--tertiary);
  margin-top:auto;
  padding-top:8px;
  border-top:1px dashed var(--border-soft);
}

/* ===== Quote (opinion) ===== */
.quote-card{
  position:relative;
  background:var(--surface-low);
  border:none;
  border-left:none;
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:48px 40px 36px;
  transition:background .2s ease;
}
.quote-card::before{
  content:"format_quote";
  font-family:'Material Symbols Outlined';
  position:absolute;
  top:24px;
  left:32px;
  font-size:36px;
  color:var(--primary);
  opacity:.85;
  line-height:1;
  pointer-events:none;
}
.quote-card:hover{background:var(--surface-mid)}
.quote-card .quote-en{
  font-style:italic;
  color:var(--tertiary);
  line-height:1.6;
  font-size:14px;
  margin:64px 0 12px;
}
.quote-card .quote-zh{
  font-family:var(--font-sans);
  color:var(--primary);
  line-height:1.4;
  margin:0 0 18px;
  font-size:24px;
  font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:-0.015em;
}
.quote-card .quote-en + .quote-zh{margin-top:0}
.quote-card:not(:has(.quote-en)) .quote-zh{margin-top:64px}
.quote-title{
  font-size:13px;
  color:var(--tertiary);
  margin-bottom:12px;
  letter-spacing:.02em;
}
.quote-card .person{
  font-family:var(--font-sans);
  color:var(--primary);
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:700;
  text-align:left;
  margin-top:20px;
  letter-spacing:.02em;
}
.quote-card .meta{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:10px;
  align-items:center;
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--tertiary);
  margin-top:18px;
  padding-top:14px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--border-soft);
}

/* ===== Tags ===== */
.tag{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  padding:3px 8px;
  border-radius:3px;
  font-size:10.5px;
  font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:.1em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  border:1px solid transparent;
  background:transparent;
}
.tag-hot{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft)}
.tag-star{color:var(--highlight);border-color:var(--highlight);background:var(--highlight-soft)}
.tag-pin{color:var(--positive);border-color:var(--positive);background:var(--positive-soft)}
.tag-industry{color:var(--info);border-color:var(--info);background:var(--info-soft)}
.tag-opinion{color:var(--primary);border-color:var(--primary);background:var(--surface-mid)}
.tag-chinese{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft)}
.tag-academic{color:var(--positive);border-color:var(--positive);background:var(--positive-soft)}
.tag-benchmark{color:var(--highlight);border-color:var(--highlight);background:var(--highlight-soft)}
.tag-headline{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft)}

/* ===== Link button ===== */
.link-btn{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:4px;
  padding:5px 10px;
  background:transparent;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:3px;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:.04em;
  color:var(--primary);
  transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease,color .15s ease;
}
.link-btn:hover{
  background:var(--primary);
  border-color:var(--primary);
  color:#fff;
  opacity:1;
}

/* ===== Empty state ===== */
.empty{
  padding:32px;
  text-align:center;
  color:var(--tertiary);
  background:var(--surface-low);
  border:1px dashed var(--border);
  border-radius:6px;
  font-size:14px;
}

/* ===== Footer ===== */
.footer{
  margin-top:96px;
  background:var(--surface-low);
  color:var(--secondary);
  border-top:1px solid var(--border-soft);
}
.footer .footer-grid{
  max-width:var(--container);
  margin:0 auto;
  padding:80px 24px 32px;
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr;
  gap:48px;
}
@media(min-width:768px){
  .footer .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;padding:96px 24px 32px}
}
@media(min-width:1024px){.footer .footer-grid{padding:96px 64px 32px}}
.footer .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.footer .brand .name{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.footer .brand p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--secondary);max-width:320px}
.footer h4{
  font-size:11px;
  font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:.16em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--primary);
  margin-bottom:18px;
}
.footer ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.footer ul a,.footer p a{
  color:var(--secondary);
  font-size:13px;
  border:none;
  transition:color .2s ease;
}
.footer ul a:hover,.footer p a:hover{color:var(--primary);opacity:1}
.footer .footer-bottom{
  border-top:1px solid var(--border-soft);
  max-width:var(--container);
  margin:0 auto;
  padding:24px;
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--tertiary);
  text-align:center;
  line-height:1.7;
}
@media(min-width:1024px){.footer .footer-bottom{padding:24px 64px}}
.footer .footer-bottom p{margin-bottom:6px}

/* ===== Responsive ===== */
@media(max-width:639px){
  body{font-size:15px}
  .hero{padding:64px 20px 56px}
  .container{padding:0 20px}
  .lede{margin-bottom:64px;font-size:17px}
  .lede::first-letter{font-size:52px}
  .section{margin-bottom:64px}
  .quote-card{padding:40px 24px 28px}
  .quote-card::before{top:20px;left:20px;font-size:30px}
  .quote-card .quote-zh{font-size:20px}
  .news-card{padding:24px 22px 22px}
  .headline-card{padding-left:18px}
  .headline-card h3{font-size:20px}
}

/* ===== Print ===== */
@media print{
  body{background:#fff;color:#000}
  .sticky-nav,.footer{display:none}
  .news-card,.headline-card,.quote-card,.lede{
    break-inside:avoid;
    background:#fff;
    border:1px solid #ccc;
    color:#000;
    box-shadow:none;
  }
  .hero{background:#fff;color:#000;border-bottom:2px solid #000}
  .hero h1,.hero .date,.hero .theme{color:#000}
  .hero .date{background:#000;color:#fff}
  a{color:#000;text-decoration:underline;border-bottom:none}
}

{% block extra_css %}{% endblock %}
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% block body %}{% endblock %}
<footer class="footer">
  {% block footer_extra %}{% endblock %}
  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <p>本日报基于公开信息自动搜索整理生成，资讯来源包括 OpenAI / Anthropic / DeepMind 等官方博客、The Verge、TechCrunch、36kr、机器之心、量子位、ArXiv、Hacker News 等公开平台。内容可能存在时效性偏差或不完整，请以原始来源为准。</p>
    <p>Generated at {{ generated_at }} · Powered by DeepSeek + public sources · <a href="{{ home_url }}">AInformer</a> · <a href="{{ api_manifest_url }}">JSON API</a></p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
